<view class="page assess-page">
  <view class="assess-heading">
    <view class="assess-heading-title">健康自测</view>
    <view class="assess-heading-sub">根据近两周感受作答，结果只保存在本机</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card assess-card" bindtap="openCat">
    <view class="assess-icon">CAT</view>
    <view class="assess-copy">
      <view class="assess-title">CAT 问卷</view>
      <view class="assess-text">8 个问题 · 每项 0-5 分，评估症状对生活的影响</view>
      <view class="assess-hint">得分 &gt; 16 分提示高风险，建议联系医生</view>
    </view>
    <text class="chevron">›</text>
  </view>

  <view class="card assess-card" bindtap="openMmrc">
    <view class="assess-icon">M</view>
    <view class="assess-copy">
      <view class="assess-title">mMRC 分级</view>
      <view class="assess-text">单选 0-4 级，评估呼吸困难程度</view>
      <view class="assess-hint">2 级及以上呼吸困难明显，建议就医</view>
    </view>
    <text class="chevron">›</text>
  </view>

  <view class="card assess-card" bindtap="openHistory">
    <view class="assess-icon">史</view>
    <view class="assess-copy">
      <view class="assess-title">自测历史</view>
      <view class="assess-text">查看以往 CAT 与 mMRC 记录及结果解读</view>
    </view>
    <text class="chevron">›</text>
  </view>

  <view class="assess-note">本自测结果不能替代专业诊断，如有不适请及时就医。</view>
</view>
